abstract: "A browser-only questionnaire that generates an AI addendum to a tax or accounting firm's written information security plan (WISP) and a gap report, mapped to the FTC Safeguards Rule, IRC Section 7216, and IRS OPR Issue 2026-19."
keywords: [WISP, Safeguards Rule, tax, accounting, artificial intelligence, Section 7216]
